                                        "entry_id": "78a50859-d038-38f8-a79c-54d3fd84cf98",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A countdown."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "48dd0ffe-945a-35cb-b515-2a0db26288ad",
                                        "entry_id": "78a50859-d038-38f8-a79c-54d3fd84cf98",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A distinct and separate charge in an indictment or complaint."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be946649-f7b1-458c-9d2b-f3d997229a1b",
                                                "sense_id": "48dd0ffe-945a-35cb-b515-2a0db26288ad",
                                                "text": "Zou, who was living in Elephant and Castle, south-east London, was convicted of 11 counts of rape, with two of the offences relating to one victim. He was also convicted of three counts of voyeurism, 10 of possession of an extreme pornographic image, one of false imprisonment and three of possession of a controlled drug with intent to commit a sexual offence."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "921efc3a-1008-33be-9108-1d22e6f84437",
                                        "entry_id": "78a50859-d038-38f8-a79c-54d3fd84cf98",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The number of balls and strikes, respectively, on a batter's in-progress plate appearance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db8613b5-7b67-4145-94e1-df21e94e2a00",
                                                "sense_id": "921efc3a-1008-33be-9108-1d22e6f84437",
                                                "text": "He has a 3–2 count with the bases loaded."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3b54f5a8-412f-343e-b432-f2626b85ef3f",
                                        "entry_id": "78a50859-d038-38f8-a79c-54d3fd84cf98",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An object of interest or account; value; estimation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c7d81d63-96f3-44c7-b3d2-6f95b9243542",
                                                "sense_id": "3b54f5a8-412f-343e-b432-f2626b85ef3f",
                                                "text": "When he was readie to his steede to mount / Vnto his way, which now was all his care and count."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c4d894da-acf8-35b2-9826-59674ec971d9",
                                        "entry_id": "78a50859-d038-38f8-a79c-54d3fd84cf98",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Cunt (the taboo swear word)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "euphemistic",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e81d0964-0cb9-46c6-8c3e-ab04b85ab6c2",
                                                "sense_id": "c4d894da-acf8-35b2-9826-59674ec971d9",
                                                "text": "That count deserves a punishment."
